This program is a port of AMOS Professional. Francois Lionet published its
68000 source under the MIT licence in 2020, and the LICENSE file of that
release carries the first two copyright lines above. Its README adds one
condition: "This source-code is published under the MIT licence, which means
you can do anything you want from it as long as the copyright notice is
present in both the modified source code and the boot screen of the
application." The escape screen prints it, and so does the About box.
